{
  "name": "Assassinate",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are at your deadliest when you get the drop on your enemies. You have Advantage on Attack Rolls against any creature that hasn't taken a turn in the combat yet. When you use your Sneak Attack against a creature on the first turn of combat that hasn't acted yet or that you are hidden, the number of d6s that you roll as part of your Sneak Attack's damage increases by an amount equal to your Proficiency.</p>",
